{"product_id":"to-your-eternity-2","title":"To Your Eternity 2","description":"\u003cp\u003eA new manga from the creator of the acclaimed A Silent Voice, featuring intimate, emotional drama and an epic story spanning time and space...A lonely boy wandering the Arctic regions of North America meets a wolf, and the two become fast friends, depending on each other to survive the harsh environment. But the boy has a history, and the wolf is more than meets the eye as well... To Your Eternity is a totally unique and moving manga about death, life, reincarnation, and the nature of love.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 146 x 208\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Oima Yoshitoki\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781632365729\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 192\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45841446863001,"sku":"Manga-A-39781632365729","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/69024e955a4c2_images__4.jpg?v=1761759459","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/to-your-eternity-2","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}